Title: The Long Rain
Author: Demo Writer

INT. POLICE STATION - NIGHT

MEERA stares at an unsolved CASE FILE, a photo of a missing girl clipped inside.

MEERA
I'll find her before the rain stops.

CUT TO:

INT. TEA STALL - DAY

VEERU watches Meera from across the road, stirring cold tea.

VEERU
She doesn't even know I exist.

CUT TO:

INT. TERRACE - NIGHT

Meera spreads maps under a single bulb. Thunder.

MEERA
One of these rooftops is lying to me.
